<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates close steady at 20.875/21.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates close steady at 20.875/21.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates closed unchanged in slack trade on Monday in apparent sign of sufficient money supply, dealers said.</p>
<p>The overnight rates ended at 20.875/21.00 percent, unchanged from the opening level.</p>
<p>&quot;It seems that everybody has enough money,&quot; said Erika Kaiser of Budapest Bank. &quot;There are only a few players on the market,&quot; she added.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
